-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §18 גמול השתלמות: for a teacher under the
-- reform, from תשע"ב — a ceiling of 18 training-allowance units; a further
-- unit for one who had studied for 17 and been recognised for 16; which
-- courses count toward the 18th; one unit a year at most, save in a year of
-- sabbatical or unpaid leave; 30 hours of school-based training a year; the
-- principal's signature on the development plan; the other rules unchanged.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `18 גמול השתלמות`

DECLARE `Oz section 18 action` IS ONE OF
    `sign the teacher's professional development plan, in dialogue with him`

-- The opening: from תשע"ב, the section applies to a teacher employed on
-- the reform's terms, in full or in part.
@ref akn:art_18/p1
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 18 applies in` y e IF
        y AT LEAST `the school year 5772`
    AND NOT e EQUALS `off the Oz reform`

§§ `18(א)`

-- (א): the units recognised for paying the training allowance are 18 at
-- most, besides the units recognised for a double degree.
@ref akn:art_18__para_a
`the Oz ceiling of training-allowance units` MEANS 18

GIVEN `units for a double degree` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the most units recognised under section 18` `units for a double degree` IS
    `the Oz ceiling of training-allowance units` PLUS `units for a double degree`

§§ `18(ב)`

-- (ב): a teacher who by the start of תשע"ב had studied the hours 17 units
-- or more require, and was recognised for 16 units only (by the rules of
-- the eve of the signing), is recognised for one more unit, out of those
-- he had studied for, from the start of his employment under the reform.
-- "16 יחידות גמול בלבד" — 16 exactly.
@ref akn:art_18__para_b
GIVEN `units his hours were worth at the start of 5772` IS A NUMBER
      `units recognised by the earlier rules` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the further unit section 18(ב) recognises` `units his hours were worth at the start of 5772` `units recognised by the earlier rules` IS
    IF      `units his hours were worth at the start of 5772` AT LEAST 17
        AND `units recognised by the earlier rules` EQUALS 16
    THEN 1
    ELSE 0

§§ `18(ג)`

-- (ג): toward the 18th unit count courses the teacher took part in that
-- began no earlier than the start of תשע"ב, or of the school year in which
-- he began to be employed under the reform, the later of the two. A school
-- year starts on 1 September (convention dates.school-year), and a course
-- that begins that day counts (convention dates.start).
@ref akn:art_18__para_c
GIVEN `the course began on` IS A DATE
      `the school year his reform employment began` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a course counts toward the 18th unit` `the course began on` `the school year his reform employment began` IF
    `the course began on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 (max `the school year 5772` `the school year his reform employment began`))

§§ `18(ד)–(ה)`

-- (ד): in each school year a teacher is entitled to one further unit at
-- most for the study hours he accumulated; hours beyond what that unit
-- requires are carried to the units of the years that follow. (ה): the
-- limit does not apply to hours studied in a year he spent on sabbatical,
-- half sabbatical or unpaid leave. How many hours a unit requires is the
-- rules on the matter, set elsewhere: the rule counts in units' worth of
-- hours. The ceiling of (א) holds throughout.
-- F-oz-founding-18-a: whether (ב)'s unit is the year's one unit under
-- (ד). The reading adopted (convention precedence.specific): (ב)'s is a
-- one-time recognition of hours studied before the reform, and (ד) limits
-- the units the hours of each year bring; the two are counted apart.
@ref akn:art_18__para_d akn:art_18__para_e
GIVEN `units the hours carried and the year's hours are worth` IS A NUMBER
      `a year of sabbatical, half sabbatical or unpaid leave` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the units the year's hours bring` `units the hours carried and the year's hours are worth` `a year of sabbatical, half sabbatical or unpaid leave` IS
    IF `a year of sabbatical, half sabbatical or unpaid leave`
    THEN `units the hours carried and the year's hours are worth`
    ELSE min 1 `units the hours carried and the year's hours are worth`

GIVEN `units the hours carried and the year's hours are worth` IS A NUMBER
      `a year of sabbatical, half sabbatical or unpaid leave` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the units' worth of hours carried to the next year` `units the hours carried and the year's hours are worth` `a year of sabbatical, half sabbatical or unpaid leave` IS
    `units the hours carried and the year's hours are worth`
        MINUS `the units the year's hours bring` `units the hours carried and the year's hours are worth` `a year of sabbatical, half sabbatical or unpaid leave`

-- The units recognised after a year: those before, (ב)'s unit in the year
-- the reform employment began, and the year's own, up to (א)'s ceiling.
GIVEN `units recognised before the year` IS A NUMBER
      `(ב)'s unit this year` IS A NUMBER
      `units the year's hours bring` IS A NUMBER
      `units for a double degree` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the units recognised after the year` `units recognised before the year` `(ב)'s unit this year` `units the year's hours bring` `units for a double degree` IS
    min (`the most units recognised under section 18` `units for a double degree`)
        (`units recognised before the year` PLUS `(ב)'s unit this year` PLUS `units the year's hours bring`)

§§ `18(ו)`

-- (ו): of the hours studied in a school-based training the Ministry
-- approved for the allowance, 30 a school year at most count toward a unit
-- ("לכל היותר": 30 is in).
@ref akn:art_18__para_f
GIVEN `hours of school-based training` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the school-based training hours that count` `hours of school-based training` IS
    min `hours of school-based training` 30

§§ `18(ז)`

-- (ז): the school's principal signs the teacher's professional development
-- plan, in dialogue with him (no deadline: convention dates.no-deadline).
@ref akn:art_18__para_g
`signing the professional development plan` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `sign the teacher's professional development plan, in dialogue with him`

§§ `18(ח)`

-- (ח): the section changes no other rule on the training allowance, nor
-- its normative standing; those rules are not this agreement's.
@ref akn:art_18__para_h
`why the other rules on the training allowance are not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "הכללים האחרים בעניין גמול השתלמות, כפי שהם"

§§ `18 -- illustrations`

#ASSERT `the most units recognised under section 18` 2 EQUALS 20
#ASSERT `the further unit section 18(ב) recognises` 17.5 16 EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the further unit section 18(ב) recognises` 16.5 16 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `a course counts toward the 18th unit` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2012) `the school year 5773`
#ASSERT NOT `a course counts toward the 18th unit` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2012) `the school year 5773`
#ASSERT `the units the year's hours bring` 2.5 FALSE EQUALS 1 AND `the units' worth of hours carried to the next year` 2.5 FALSE EQUALS 1.5
#ASSERT `the units the year's hours bring` 2 TRUE EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the school-based training hours that count` 45 EQUALS 30
-- the ceiling holds: 17 recognised and two in a year of leave make 18
#ASSERT `the units recognised after the year` 17 0 2 0 EQUALS 18

-- F-oz-founding-18-a's evidence: a teacher recognised for 16, who joins
-- the reform in תשע"ב with hours for 17 and studies a unit's worth in new
-- courses that year, ends it with 18 on the reading adopted, and with 17 if
-- (ב)'s unit were the year's one under (ד).
`(ב)'s unit and (ד)'s give two units in one year` MEANS
        `the units recognised after the year` 16 (`the further unit section 18(ב) recognises` 17 16) (`the units the year's hours bring` 1 FALSE) 0 EQUALS 18
    AND 16 PLUS min 1 (`the further unit section 18(ב) recognises` 17 16 PLUS `the units the year's hours bring` 1 FALSE) EQUALS 17
#ASSERT `(ב)'s unit and (ד)'s give two units in one year`
